  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=modloader&message=fabric&color=brightgreen\" alt=\"模組載入器：Fabric\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=environment&message=client/server&color=yellow\" alt=\"模組環境\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fAton-Kish%252fyour-reputation%252f1.21-jade%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=licence&message=MIT&color=blue\" alt=\"MIT 授權條款\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatonkish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h1>你的聲望（Jade）</h1>\n<p>「你的聲望」是一個 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a> 外掛程式，會在村民的提示資訊中顯示你的聲望值。</p>\n<p>Minecraft 1.20 之前版本的專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-reputation\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-reputation</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\" width=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聲望</th>\n<th>數值</th>\n<th>提示資訊</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>友善</td>\n<td>100 或以上</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/friendly.png\" alt=\"友善\" width=\"227\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠</td>\n<td>大於 0 且小於 100</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/trustworthy.png\" alt=\"可靠\" width=\"240\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中立</td>\n<td>等於 0</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/neutral.png\" alt=\"中立\" width=\"228\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可疑</td>\n<td>大於 -100 且小於 0</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/suspicious.png\" alt=\"可疑\" width=\"232\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敵對</td>\n<td>-100 或更低</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/hostile.png\" alt=\"敵對\" width=\"227\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>如果你的聲望為「敵對」，村民會變成告密者。</p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/snitch.png\" alt=\"告密者\" width=\"227\">\n<p>接著，鐵魔像會變得憤怒並開始攻擊你……</p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-jade/images/angry_golem.png\" alt=\"憤怒的鐵魔像\" width=\"241\">",
